{
  "_comment": [
    "Single source of truth for the Bluebell International School brand colours.",
    "Sampled from brand/bluebell-logo-master.png with tools/sample-palette.mjs:",
    "of 529,662 coloured pixels 44.2% are blue and 55.1% yellow. Dominant blues",
    "#022aa1 (20.0%), #03289b (13.7%), #04248b, #0832a5, #011b97, #021988; the bell",
    "is #019cf2 and the laurel wreath is #fde616. Every brand green in the JMIS clone",
    "is remapped onto this ramp by tools/rebrand.mjs (it reads greenToBlue below);",
    "the SOURCE side of every rule is byte-identical to the JMIS green set so a",
    "future JMIS port needs no new rules.",
    "Status greens (attendance \"present\", payment \"paid\") are NOT brand colours and",
    "are never remapped - see keepGreen.",
    "DECORATIVE-ONLY RULE: accentCyan (#019cf2, 2.98:1 on white) and accentGold",
    "(#fde616, 1.27:1 on white) both fail WCAG 3:1 for graphical objects, so neither",
    "may ever carry or sit behind text. Gold on primary navy is 8.93:1 and is the",
    "approved crest combination.",
    "contrastVsWhite is the WCAG ratio of white text on the colour; >=4.5 is AA."
  ],
